# Transcity and Bilderberg are non-free display faces, kept out of this public
# repo — Transcity is a free-for-PERSONAL-USE 1001Fonts FFP demo whose licence
# permits webfont conversion but NOT publishing/redistribution (§6, §7);
# Bilderberg's terms are unconfirmed. Neither is used anywhere in the app today
# (both are unused legacy @font-face candidates in index.css, superseded by
# Bungee Shade). Bungee Shade — the ACTIVE .brand-wordmark face — is a free
# Google Font (OFL) and is committed normally, not listed here.
# See frontend/public/fonts/README.md before changing this.
